        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are successful restaurateurs. Their dreams have come true, but there is a new vacation and a new adventure ahead. The heroes go on a well-deserved vacation on a cruise ship, where Matthew is going to take a serious step for their life together, but new troubles stand in the way of the restaurateurs, delaying them with their heads in. Will Tammy and Matthew be able to save the cruise from collapse and feed the whole ship, and will this interfere with Matt’s mysterious goals? Find out in our fascinating story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a lot of emotions while cruising the oceans of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn all the secrets of cooking and enjoy this adventure to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional controls and clear tutorials will help you easily understand the basics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Travel Cuisine 3&quot;&quot; - a cozy adventure through different restaurants around the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best dishes of world cultures - Chicken curry, Pho bo, Pizza, bibimbap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are a couple of young restaurateurs who will always be with you on your adventures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful plot, colorful comics and characters, each with their own mood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay, the opportunity to feel like a master in the kitchen of an elite cruise ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cheerful and very hungry customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 hours of addictive gameplay for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice theme music.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are successful restaurateurs. Their dreams have come true, but there is a new vacation and a new adventure ahead. The heroes go on a well-deserved vacation on a cruise ship, where Matthew is going to take a serious step for their life together, but new troubles stand in the way of the restaurateurs, delaying them with their heads in. Will Tammy and Matthew be able to save the cruise from collapse and feed the whole ship, and will this interfere with Matt’s mysterious goals? Find out in our fascinating story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a lot of emotions while cruising the oceans of the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn all the secrets of cooking and enjoy this adventure to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional controls and clear tutorials will help you easily understand the basics of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Travel Cuisine 3&quot;&quot; - a cozy adventure through different restaurants around the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best dishes of world cultures - Chicken curry, Pho bo, Pizza, bibimbap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tammy and Matthew are a couple of young restaurateurs who will always be with you on your adventures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful plot, colorful comics and characters, each with their own mood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay, the opportunity to feel like a master in the kitchen of an elite cruise ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cheerful and very hungry customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 hours of addictive gameplay for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice theme music.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Travel cuisine 3 is an interesting strategy about an experienced couple of restaurateurs rescuing a tourist liner from trouble.",
